@0imzero/dsh-workspace-menu README · DSH Workspace Menu：**简体中文** · [English](README.en.md)

给 DSH 首页的工作区和会话加上右键菜单。双击也能打开：需要重命名、复制路径或归档会话时，不用再到处找按钮。

> **兼容性：** v2.0.0 及以后适用于 DSH 0.2.x（`>= 0.2.1-rc.3`）。DSH 0.1.x 请使用 [v1.2.0](https://github.com/0imzero/dsh-workspace-menu/releases/tag/v1.2.0)。

@0imzero/dsh-workspace-menu README · DSH Workspace Menu：[简体中文](README.md) · **English**

Add a context menu to workspaces and chats on the DSH home page. Right-click or double-click a row to rename it, copy a path, archive a chat, and more.

> **Compatibility:** v2.0.0 and later support DSH 0.2.x (`>= 0.2.1-rc.3`). For DSH 0.1.x, use [v1.2.0](https://github.com/0imzero/dsh-workspace-menu/releases/tag/v1.2.0).
